---
title: Contact
layout: layouts/page.njk
permalink: /contact/
wide: true
hero_heading: Get in touch
hero_subtext: Whether you want to give, volunteer, refer someone, or just ask a question, we would like to hear from you.
meta_description: Contact Oasis Women Center in Denton County, Texas. Call 214-815-6327 or email info@oasiswomencenter.org.
---

<section class="sec sec-paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="railed">
      <div class="rail reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Reach us</span>
        <h2 class="sec-title">A real person answers.</h2>
        <p class="sec-lead" style="margin-top:20px;">Keisha Ortiz, Founder and Board Chair, reads and answers messages sent to our main inbox.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal d1">
        <dl class="facts">
          <div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="text-decoration:underline">{{ site.email }}</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:{{ site.phone | replace('-', '') }}" style="text-decoration:underline">{{ site.phone }}</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Service area</dt><dd>{{ site.service_area }}</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="note" style="margin-top:28px;">If you need our mailing address for a donation, a legal notice, or grant paperwork, email or call us and we will provide it directly.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:40px;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/give/">Ways to give</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline-ink" href="/programs/" style="margin-left:10px;">Our programs</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-paper" id="form">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="railed">
      <div class="rail reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Send a message</span>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Tell us what you need.</h2>
        <p class="sec-lead" style="margin-top:20px;">Looking for housing, referring a woman to us, offering to volunteer, or asking about a gift. Whatever it is, write it here and we will answer.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal d1">
        <form class="ls-form" novalidate>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-name">Your name</label>
            <input id="f-name" data-ls-field="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-email">Email</label>
            <input id="f-email" data-ls-field="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-phone">Phone <span class="opt">(optional)</span></label>
            <input id="f-phone" data-ls-field="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel">
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-message">How can we help?</label>
            <textarea id="f-message" data-ls-field="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
            <label for="f-website">Website</label>
            <input id="f-website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
          </div>
          <p class="form-notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send message</button>
          <p class="note" style="margin-top:18px;">We never share your information. If you would rather not use this form, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="text-decoration:underline">{{ site.email }}</a> or call {{ site.phone }}.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec-warm">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="railed">
      <div class="rail reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Organization</span>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Our standing.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal d1">
        <dl class="facts">
          <div><dt>Legal name</dt><dd>Oasis Women Center</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>501(c)(3) nonprofit organization</dd></div>
          <div><dt>EIN</dt><dd>{{ site.ein }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>State of incorporation</dt><dd>Texas</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Founded</dt><dd>2024</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="note" style="margin-top:26px;">Contributions are tax deductible to the extent allowed by law.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
